      "widgets_values": [
        "qwen3-tts-voice-design",
        "Qwen3-TTS Voice Design",
        "text-to-speech",
        "",
        "Create a voice locally from a natural-language description and speak the supplied text.",
        "Qwen",
        "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign",
        "The prompt is the exact text to speak. Set language to the target language; voice direction belongs in instruct, not in the spoken text. For long narration, generate sentence or paragraph sections, reuse the same voice, and assemble the audio before generating video. Describe voice identity and delivery in instruct. To keep the resulting voice across later jobs, use an accepted sample as the reference for voice cloning."
      ]
